<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρόγρᾰφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>written with the hand,
				holograph, manuscript,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμβολον, ἀσφάλ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ια</span>,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				303
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.75.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρόγρᾰφον</span></b> , τό,
				<i>manuscript note,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1013.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				30.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				5.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				3.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καθ᾽ ἡμῶν χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Col.</u>
					2.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>note of hand, bond,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PRein.
				7.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.829a
			</span></i>, etc.; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρόγρᾰφος</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				4629
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Syria</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> parox., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρογράφος
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ὁ,</span>
			<i>clerk, amanuensis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				209
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
